{"overview":"لویس با مکس، عشق زندگی‌اش، به بِلروز می‌آید؛ لِین، خالق برنامهٔ Campus Drivers که در دانشگاه پرطرفدار است و به‌هیچ‌وجه به‌علاقه‌مند شدن مشهور است، هرگز قرار نبود مسیرشان به‌هم برسد، اما برخی برخوردها همه چیز را تغییر می‌دهند، زخم‌های قدیمی را دوباره باز می‌کنند و وقتی عشق به‌طور ناگهانی ظاهر می‌شود، دیگر هیچ‌چیز قطعی نیست.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Lois arrives in Belrose with Max, the love of her life. Lane, the creator of Campus Drivers, the hottest app on campus, is known for never getting attached. Their paths were never meant to cross. But some encounters change everything, reopening old wounds. And when love appears unexpectedly, nothing is certain anymore.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2026,"poster":"/oPltcyfWWfVmxB6lV8JZZJV3m7Q.jpg"}],"episodes":6,"crew":["Tom Goris","Vianney Lebasque","Thomas Boullé"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["FR","BE"],"cast":[{"name":"Carmen Kassovitz","role":"Loïs","photo":"/iNLGKtgKWrnHjfZtUbLEwTjJPlf.jpg"},{"name":"Baptiste Masseline","role":"Lane","photo":"/yM0TUy6pKm9nIPSZi5XMUZm7vqB.jpg"},{"name":"Esteban Vial","role":"Lewis","photo":"/bS61EfCCt77ZpG2fRYZm8cOdVTY.jpg"},{"name":"Félix Nebel","role":"Adam","photo":"/4hRE5xTDVrn7VlXL9hb3YBTSQW3.jpg"},{"name":"Madior Fall","role":"Donovan","photo":"/aHEr670j2N4VZuai0mF6XhkR9mY.jpg"},{"name":"Cassandra Cano","role":"Emma","photo":"/wlFpi2eNsrRdMET9nrIRI2262vd.jpg"},{"name":"Eloïse Rey","role":"Carrie","photo":"/xY9uPf0PGBAxgjXPObGLk6c5GIh.jpg"},{"name":"Prune Pauchet","role":"Emilie","photo":"/vBUANoC8vmMRBe7CGeMFV8juWst.jpg"},{"name":"Enzo Lorente","role":"Max","photo":""},{"name":"Paolo Luka Noé","role":"Aaron","photo":"/3Whc0yseMikmH4wKM06ccSf3TEH.jpg"},{"name":"Louna Balavoine","role":"Becca","photo":""},{"name":"Eva Hatik","role":"Avril","photo":""}],"trailer":"xybsbjGt1KA","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/303044-campus-drivers/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video